WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:03.167
You're father of ten
children,

00:00:03.209 --> 00:00:08.375
ages two to 31 and a grandbaby,
a year and a half.

00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:12.709
What is it about being
a father--

00:00:12.751 --> 00:00:14.918
I'm not--
not even that you love,

00:00:14.959 --> 00:00:18.501
how did the experience

00:00:18.542 --> 00:00:23.667
of becoming a father
multiple times

00:00:23.709 --> 00:00:26.751
change you as a man,
as a human?

00:00:26.792 --> 00:00:30.125
Wow, that's too much to say.

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:31.792
Well, just give me a little
bit of that.

00:00:31.834 --> 00:00:35.209
- Give me a little bit.
- Yeah, I will say that, uh,

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.459
my children are the center
of my life.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:43.292
And having children
and having family,

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:47.167
it keeps you grounded
and centered.

00:00:47.209 --> 00:00:51.375
If you put your children first,

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.709
before you make any decision,

00:00:53.751 --> 00:00:55.834
you'll never make
a bad decision.

00:00:55.876 --> 00:01:01.709
- Mm. That's brilliant.
- Never. You never make one
bad decision

00:01:01.751 --> 00:01:04.459
- if you put them first.
- So is that what you were doing

00:01:04.501 --> 00:01:06.375
those years you were resting
on the couch?

00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:08.709
- Is that what you were doing?
- That's what I've been--

00:01:08.751 --> 00:01:11.459
that's what I've been doing--
that's what I've been doing
since I had them.

00:01:11.501 --> 00:01:16.334
Putting them first.
They've been first, you know?

00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:18.709
- Yeah. That's so powerful.
- They're first.
Somebody said to me--

00:01:18.751 --> 00:01:22.125
I was talking to somebody
last week and they were like--

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:25.042
what did they say? It was like,
"So this movie 'Coming 2
America.'

00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:27.292
This is your legacy.
And your legacy--"

00:01:27.334 --> 00:01:30.751
And I was like, "My legacy?
My legacy is not movies.

00:01:30.792 --> 00:01:34.626
My legacy is my children.
Not my-- my movies."

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:37.042
When I die, ain't nobody gonna
be at my funeral

00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.626
standing over the coffin going,
"Then first he did '48 Hours,'

00:01:39.667 --> 00:01:41.667
then he moved on to
'Trading Places.'

00:01:41.709 --> 00:01:43.792
And the he did the great
'Beverly Hills Cop.'

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:44.959
Let's show a clip.

